# 🔴 WORKER SECRETS FOR LOCAL DEVELOPMENT — the local twin of the Cloudflare
# secret. It holds the same Rollbar token, so it is a credential and it is never
# committed. Production reads ROLLBAR_SERVER_TOKEN from the Worker's own secret
# store; this file only matters to `wrangler dev`.
.dev.vars

